NAME

ulibRelinkFile - Deletes a file entry and adds a file entry


SYNOPSIS

ulibRelinkFile(struct FileCat *File1, struct FileCat *File2)
                         a0                    a1


DESCRIPTION

This function removes <File1> from the catalogue, and then immediately adds
<File2> to the catalogue, as one virtually atomic operation.

This function is used to a rename a file, or change its section or upload
date.  In fact, this function must be used instead of ulibUpdateFile() if a
file's section, name, or date uploaded is changed.


RETURNS

0        - Success
Non-zero - Failure

              2 - Error adding <File2> to the catalogue
              3 - Error deleting <File1> from the catalogue; <File2> not added
